  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mkulu wa Ansembe wa Pangano Latsopano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fundo yayikulu pa zimene tikunenazi ndi iyi: Tili naye ife Mkulu wa ansembe, amene anakhala ku dzanja lamanja la mpando waufumu wa Mulungu Waulemerero kumwamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo akutumikira mʼmalo opatulika, mu Tenti yeniyeni yoyikidwa ndi Ambuye, osati ndi munthu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkulu wa ansembe aliyense amasankhidwa kuti azipereka mphatso ndi nsembe kwa Mulungu, ndipo kunali koyenera kuti wansembe wathunso akhale nʼkanthu kopereka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngati iye akanakhala pa dziko lapansi, sakanakhala wansembe pakuti alipo kale anthu amene amapereka mphatso zolembedwa mʼMalamulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwo amatumikira pamalo opatulika amene ndi chithunzi ndi chifanizo cha zimene zili kumwamba. Ichi ndi chifukwa chake Mose anachenjezedwa pamene anali pafupi kumanga Tenti: \"Uwonetsetse kuti wapanga zonse monga momwe ndikukuonetsera pa phiri pano.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma Yesu analandira utumiki wopambana kuposa wawo monga Iyenso ali Nkhoswe ya pangano lopambana kuposa lakale lija, chifukwa pangano latsopano lakhazikika pa malonjezano opambana kwambiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngati pangano loyamba lija likanakhala langwiro, sipakanafunikanso lina mʼmalo mwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma Mulungu anapeza zolakwika pakati pa anthu ndipo anati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Masiku akubwera,\" akutero Yehova,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"pamene ndidzachita pangano latsopano",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndi Aisraeli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndiponso nyumba ya Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Silidzakhala ngati pangano",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "limene ndinachita ndi makolo awo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "pamene ndinawagwira padzanja",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nʼkuwatulutsa ku Igupto",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "chifukwa iwo sanasunge pangano langa lija",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndipo Ine sindinawasamalire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q4",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "akutero Ambuye.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsono ili ndi pangano ndidzapangane ndi nyumba ya Israeli:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atapita masiku amenewa, akutero Ambuye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ine ndidzayika malamulo anga mʼmaganizo mwawo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndi kulemba mʼmitima mwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ine ndidzakhala Mulungu wawo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndipo iwo adzakhala anthu anga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sipadzafunikanso wina kuti aphunzitse mnzake,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kapena munthu kuphunzitsa mʼbale wake, kunena kuti, udziwe Ambuye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "chifukwa onse adzandidziwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kuyambira wamngʼono mpaka wamkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti Ine ndidzawakhululukira zoyipa zawo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndipo sindidzakumbukiranso machimo awo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ponena kuti, pangano \"latsopano\" Mulungu wapanga pangano loyamba lija kukhala lotha ntchito, ndipo chilichonse chimene chayamba kutha ntchito ndi kukalamba, chili pafupi kuchokeratu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
